    "completeness": 0.35,
    "open_questions": [
      "No human transcription of his Weather Report parts is free to read (the published ones are in Modern Drummer Legends: Peter Erskine, Hal Leonard 2021). All three songs are rebuilt from machine Songsterr tabs: their tempo, swing and form are checked against the records; their bars within the beat are not.",
      "Birdland's kick: the tab writes it under every note of Pastorius's line (the \"and\"s of 1 and 2 as well); the record's mix cannot separate the two, and the song plays the tab's lighter bar (43-49).",
      "Teen Town's vamp (Offenbach bars 232-236, 243-248, 261-266): the tab puts Black Market's snare figure under it; left out until a source or a clearer recording settles it.",
      "Swing on the ride, his jazz playing (Night Passage, Rockin' in Rhythm, the ECM trios), is not scored: no transcription of it was found."
    ]
  },
